  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aus4ASEAN Futures Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia for ASEAN (Aus4ASEAN) Futures is the flagship investment under the ASEAN-Australia Comprehensive Strategic Partnership. It supports ASEAN-led projects across all three ASEAN community pillars: Economic, Socio-Cultural, and Political-Security. This flexible, demand-driven initiative offers tangible technical support for ASEAN priorities through ASEAN regional architecture. The end of program outcomes are: (1) ASEAN Member States&#x2019; planning, policies and programs more effectively support all Communities to promote: Economic integration, competitiveness, innovation and connectivity; inclusive, sustainable, resilient, and dynamic communities; and peaceful, rules-based systems; (2) ASEAN programs, plans and policies more effectively integrate cross-cutting issues including climate change, social inclusion, gender equality and disability; and (3) Australia is recognised for its positive contribution to ASEAN.</narrative>
  </description>
